Provenance within this repository
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

src/gpu/test_gemm_contract.py came back from uzbekunknown/dlss-nr-on-intel, which
adapted this tree's CMake build and GEMM checks (commit 74bc1f7) and strengthened the
epilogue and destination-guard tests.

This project was written by AI agents: Claude Opus 5 in this tree, and Astra in a parallel
one by the same owner. `src/ref/nr_image.c` began in that parallel tree and was extended
here; its file header and `notes/phase57-native-host-passes.md` record what came from
where. See "How this was built" in README.md.
